          "NlmCategory": "CONCLUSIONS",
          "Label": "CONCLUSION",
          "content": "Interventional radiologists are often responsible for sedation and pain management in the majority of interventional radiology procedures. Peripheral nerve block is increasingly being used in interventional radiology."
